definition : You pick up one card at a time and slide it into the right spot among the cards you already hold.
time : o(n^2)
space : o(1)

[2 5 9 1] →[2 5 9 9] →[2 5 5 9] →[2 2 5 9] → [1 2 5 9]

def insertion_sort(a):
    for i in range(1, len(a)):
        key = a[i]
        j = i - 1
        while j >= 0 and a[j] > key:
            a[j + 1] = a[j]
            j -= 1
        a[j + 1] = key
    return a
